# =============================================================================
# 换行符与二进制归一化
#
# 背景：本仓库长期在 Windows 上开发（core.autocrlf=true），却一直没有
# .gitattributes。结果 OHOS 移植提交里混入了 CRLF 归一化，使 lib/main.dart 等
# 文件的 diff 从 ~500 行膨胀到 ~3900 行（纯换行符噪声），严重妨碍 review 与
# 日后合并上游。此文件把规则固定下来：仓库内文本一律 LF。
#
# 生效方式（一次性）：git add --renormalize .
# =============================================================================

# 默认：自动识别文本/二进制，文本在仓库内统一存 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- Windows 原生脚本与工程文件必须保持 CRLF ----
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj.filters text eol=crlf
*.props text eol=crlf
*.rc text eol=crlf

# ---- 明确标记为二进制：禁止 git 做换行转换或文本 diff ----
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.o binary
*.exe binary
*.hap binary
*.app binary
*.jar binary
*.p12 binary
*.p7b binary
*.cer binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.pem binary
*.mobileprovision binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.avif binary
*.heic binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.rawheap binary
*.heapsnapshot binary
